    "Name": "Sea Wolf",
    "Details": "This unusual Sea Wolf configuration was designed and piloted by saKhan Savarok of Clan Ghost Bear. This loadout carries a unique Railgun, designed specifically for punching holes in large fortified targets, fused to the chassis. Using this 'Mech allowed Savarok to get the killing blow on the first confirmed 'Mech kill of a Rattler Mobile Fortress.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.42</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
